-- Regression fixture for LIBRARY-RESOLUTION-SHADOW-SPEC (Option B′).
--
-- This file lives alone in its directory: no project-root or sibling copy of
-- `prelude` exists, so with JL4_LIBRARY_PATH unset the import must fall
-- through the project-scoped tiers. The CLI test plants a POISONED prelude in
-- a fabricated XDG store (~/.local/share/jl4/libraries): under the pre-B′
-- ordering that ambient copy shadowed the binary's own embedded stdlib and
-- this check would fail; under B′ the embedded copy outranks it and the check
-- succeeds — with a warning naming both differing copies (Option E).
IMPORT prelude

ok MEANS TRUE
